[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844322392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115831#issuecomment-3844322392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115831","id":3844322392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lI7RY","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T23:17:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T23:17:43Z","body":"Regression from 4.6 dev 5, bisecting.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844322392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844563458","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115831#issuecomment-3844563458","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115831","id":3844563458,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lJ2IC","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T00:30:01Z","body":"Bisected to #106071. From what PR says this was an intentional change so it's not a bug. In this case what can be done to workaround is something like:\n\n```\nextends Node3D\n\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_TYPE_STRING, \"Node3D\") var value: String;\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar _class_name\n\tif value.is_absolute_path():\n\t\tvar class_load = load(value)\n\t\t_class_name = (class_load as Script).get_global_name()\n\t\n\telse:\n\t\t_class_name = value\n\t\n\tprint(_class_name)\n\tprint(ClassDB.can_instantiate(_class_name))\n```\n\n<br>\n\n@AThousandShips What should be done about this issue as this was an intentional change?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844563458/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3849880356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115831#issuecomment-3849880356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115831","id":3849880356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7leIMk","user":{"login":"paulcnova","id":37953532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTUzNTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37953532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova","html_url":"https://github.com/paulcnova","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulcnova/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T21:40:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T21:40:12Z","body":"Oh, if this was an intentional change, then I don't think it should regress back. The work around works and I will just use that on top of the code that I have.\n\nIf I may suggest, either a toggle on the dialog box switch between new and old functionalities or a pattern on the hint, such as `\"<class_name>:N\"`, to notate that it would return just the name of the node; or a mix of both.\n\nIf that seems like too much for this issue, then I'd suggest to close this issue and update the docs to reflect the new functionality, as it currently says:\n\n> The property will store the selected type as a string.\n\nfound here: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_@globalscope.html#class-globalscope-constant-p